---
// src/components/AboutUs.astro
---
<section id="about" class="py-24 bg-white border-y border-brand-100 scroll-mt-16">
  <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-16 items-start">
      
      <div class="lg:col-span-5">
        <h2 class="text-sm font-extrabold text-brand-600 tracking-widest uppercase mb-3">Your Export Desk in India</h2>
        
        <h3 class="text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-6 leading-tight tracking-tight">
          Global Supply. <br/>Institutional Scale.
        </h3>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 mb-6 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          Based in the industrial hub of Tamil Nadu, India, EcoLyf bridges the gap between global demand for sustainable packaging and India's highest-grade bagasse production lines.
        </p>
        
        <p class="text-lg text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
          We manage the end-to-end export operations, securing high-volume supply, enforcing rigorous QA/QC protocols, and facilitating frictionless CIF/FOB logistics for international distributors worldwide.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="lg:col-span-7 grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-8">
        
        <div class="bg-brand-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600 border border-brand-200 shadow-sm mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Our Mission</h4>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            To aggressively eliminate single-use plastics from global supply chains by securing and distributing enterprise-grade bagasse tableware without compromising on export reliability.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="bg-brand-50 p-8 rounded-2xl border border-brand-100 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow">
          <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-white rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center text-brand-600 border border-brand-200 shadow-sm mb-6">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"></path><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"></path></svg>
          </div>
          <h4 class="text-xl font-black text-brand-950 mb-4 uppercase tracking-wide">Our Vision</h4>
          
          <p class="text-sm text-brand-800 leading-relaxed font-medium">
            To become the world's most trusted supply chain manager for sustainable packaging, setting the international benchmark for QA/QC integrity and frictionless global trade.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
    
  </div>
</section>